Ordis	interacts with	If the Lotus does manage to break through the fleet and face him... in her current condition...
Ordis	interacts with	Your transference system is giving off unusual... that's new.
Ordis	interacts with	The Narmer fleet seems to be redeploying. Sensors show Murex clustering past Mercury. What is Ballas up to?
Ordis	interacts with	Oh joy. This... thing... seems to have survived stasis.
Ordis	interacts with	Warframe vitals, strong. Warming up nicely. I've taken the liberty of rebuilding the Paracesis. Surprising, but your transference signal is clear. This might be an odd sensation for you.
Ordis	interacts with	Scanning... Indeed. You are my Operator! You can help me run through the crosscheck if you like. Then we can --annihilate Narmer-- find the Lotus.
Ordis	interacts with	Stasis protocols lifted. Systems coming back online. Cephalon refit complete- Excuse me, but where is my Operator?
Ordis	interacts with	Exodus protocols reversed. Orbiter frontal section reattached. Running diagnostics... corrosion minimal. Ah. All seals holding.
