Ordis	interacts with	Get away from her!
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, run!
Ordis	interacts with	Run!
Ordis	interacts with	What do we do?
Ordis	interacts with	She's full-on Sentient... she doesn't know who you are!
Ordis	interacts with	I'm a little unsure about this. Last time she snapped at you, what will it be this time?
Ordis	interacts with	Two left. Just a simple choice between the horrible one and the terrifying one.
Ordis	interacts with	By the stars...
Ordis	interacts with	Hmm. A new one. I don't think I get it either.
Ordis	interacts with	Archon in the vicinity, Operat---Sorry. Old habit.
Ordis	interacts with	That interference again! There's got to be an Archon nearby.
Ordis	interacts with	I traced Eidolon signatures the best I could. These locations seem most likely.
Ordis	interacts with	Forgive me, but... this would be a lot easier if you could use that old... uh... Tenno... magic. How did you lose it?
Ordis	interacts with	Oper- Uh... You. You're alive! I can hardly believe it. He actually agreed to help?
Ordis	interacts with	This confirms that you are clearly insane.
Ordis	interacts with	Navigation is marked... but I hope you change your mind.
Ordis	interacts with	Are you serious?! It didn't occur to you that you might want to mention that before we put one ON!?
Ordis	interacts with	What? Op-- you-- you don't know what effect it will have on you. There's got to be a better way.
Ordis	interacts with	Ignore her. We can't risk it.
Ordis	interacts with	Avoid the Deacons, or they'll seal you in!
Ordis	interacts with	Wait. Deacons. They'll sense if you're not veiled. Give them a wide berth, or you'll be sucking black ooze before long.
Ordis	interacts with	Vox Solaris collapsed under Narmer. You're on your own here. Keep your head down and get topside as quick as you can.
Ordis	interacts with	Sorry, Op-- Sorry. If you want to get to the Outer systems past Narmer, we'll need a Corpus shuttle.
Ordis	interacts with	I know someone that--?! Wait. Operator, you can't be serious!
Ordis	interacts with	What do I think? I think --FINISH HER-- this is torture. What's left of her is just... just wasting away. We've tried everything. I have no 'care and feeding of Eidolons' in my data arrays. We don't know what we're dealing with.
Ordis	interacts with	Orphix fields are disabled. The Operator should be cleared to board.
Ordis	interacts with	Almost done, Teshin
Ordis	interacts with	Just one left, and Ordis will be able to safely signal the Operator to join!
Ordis	interacts with	Ordis is still happy to help!
Ordis	interacts with	Teshin? Are you - LOSING IT - feeling unwell?
Ordis	interacts with	Swing away, Teshin.
Ordis	interacts with	Yes? Would you like me to dephase that for you?
Ordis	interacts with	Observation: a power field requires a power source.
Ordis	interacts with	Grineer! Oh my. Ordis wonders what we are getting into.
Ordis	interacts with	Ah! Please excuse Ordis.
Ordis	interacts with	I'm only trying to--
Ordis	interacts with	The Orphix fields will be scattered deep in the ship. Ordis can help you triangulate them--
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	This wreckage is burning up. We will not be shielded for much longer. Keep moving.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Crew: they do not make sunblock strong enough to save us from this. Get us out of the oven.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Shields burning away. Watch your vectors.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Crew. Space frame integrity critical. This Railjack is cooking. Hug the shadows or we are done.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Entering slingshot range. Orphix pulse fields detected aboard. Get a Necramech in the barrel. You will need it.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Crisis averted. Mission continues.
