Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Crew, brace for shockwave.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Gravitational waves increasing. Helm will feel sloppy.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Engines locked.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Priority: get close enough to execute slingshot maneuver. Time transitions with solar flare events for maximum cover.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Gravimetrics are chaotic. At current rate, this Railjack will burn on approach. Weird: that thing appears to be eating the Sun.
Cephalon Cy	interacts with	Great shot, kid. That was one in a million.
