Operator	interacts with	No. No!
Operator	interacts with	No!
Operator	interacts with	Thank you.
Operator	interacts with	Understood.
Operator	interacts with	My mech's damaged! Can we take down the Orphix field?
Operator	interacts with	I know! Maybe if she was stronger we wouldn't have to!
Operator	interacts with	Alright Cy, get clear after launch.
Operator	interacts with	We have got to stop it! What if... what if we approach the wrecked ships as cover?
Operator	interacts with	What do you mean? Feed on what?
Operator	interacts with	Please. You're not thinking straight. You need more time to heal...
Operator	interacts with	You're not ready! He has manipulated you for so long. He'll just own you like he owns every other Narmer.
Operator	interacts with	Won't be necessary Ordis.
Operator	interacts with	Ordis, you picking up anything strange?
Operator	interacts with	And that she sees time all at once. I think it's just a metaphor.
Operator	interacts with	Konzu, run and hide!
Operator	interacts with	--She isn't. Not even close. We have to stop her, Ordis.
Operator	interacts with	Cetus. She's going to Cetus. She wants that Murex!
Operator	interacts with	The Drifter. I wonder...
Operator	interacts with	Hungry, no doubt.
Operator	interacts with	Alright, do it.
Operator	interacts with	Huh, it's good to be back, Ordis.
Operator	interacts with	Ordis...
Operator	interacts with	You saved her. Nursed her back to health. It has to be you.
Operator	interacts with	(gulps)
Operator	interacts with	(hmm)
Operator	interacts with	So... you've been stuck here this whole time?
Operator	interacts with	Around? Okay, so what is this, then? Are you from the--
Operator	interacts with	Ballas? Wait, so you don't know--
Operator	interacts with	I don't know.
Operator	interacts with	Yeah. Why did you--
Operator	interacts with	Yeah. But, what are--
Operator	interacts with	Uh. Yeah.
Operator	interacts with	What the hell--
Operator	interacts with	Huh, still works.
Operator	interacts with	Hello?
Operator	interacts with	You're... alive?
Operator	interacts with	(yells)
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	(gasp)
Operator	interacts with	(gasp)
Operator	interacts with	Hey, lose your light? Here, you can take mine.
Operator	interacts with	I know. But go on. Just for now.
Operator	interacts with	No. She's not. We're going to be your family for a while, okay?
Operator	interacts with	Hey. Why don't you go sit closer to the others until we get environmental back?
Operator	interacts with	I don't know, but we're going to figure it out together, okay?
Operator	interacts with	Something went wrong with the jump. But we'll survive. Promise.
Operator	interacts with	Quiet, everyone. Keep your voices down.
Operator	interacts with	(winces)
Operator	interacts with	(struggles)
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	(struggles)
Operator	interacts with	(struggles)
Operator	interacts with	I can't! I won't.
Operator	interacts with	Teshin... I'll be awaiting... so I can bring her home.
