Veso	interacts with	Drain those shields and that will force his self-repair routine.
Veso	interacts with	Got to blast those shields while I can!
Veso	interacts with	All his power is going into his attack. Shields vulnerable. Beams incredibly dangerous!
Veso	interacts with	Am... am I a traitor to the Board? Yes sir.
Veso	interacts with	Plan? You mean, I have to... Okay. I guess... hit him in the knees? Trigger his a-attack routine? That should leave his shields vulnerable. In theory...
Veso	interacts with	What if I shield that Moa?
Veso	interacts with	There has to be a way to protect that Breacher Moa.
Veso	interacts with	Sir? You want to disengage fire control from the fleet? I... I don't understand.
Veso	interacts with	Hello again, turrets. I've brought a friend this time.
Veso	interacts with	Turrets look a little less scary now that I've got a Striker Moa.
Veso	interacts with	How many hostiles ahead? I can't do this! Unless... I get a Striker Moa.
Veso	interacts with	Their shields are too strong to shoot through. Maybe if I boosted mine somehow.
Veso	interacts with	No point trying to shoot my way through this.
Veso	interacts with	There is no shame in maximizing my shields and just running.
Veso	interacts with	My shields should hold up, if I'm fast.
Veso	interacts with	A functioning shield drone dispenser? Oh, thank Profit.
Veso	interacts with	Veso. Right. I've got a datapad, secure robot dispenser access... and a Plinx. Right.
Veso	interacts with	Sir! Veso, here. Our robotics have gone rogue... the Sentients must have latched the grid!
Veso	interacts with	Aah! Why are you shooting at me?
Veso	interacts with	Hmm. A Breacher Moa could clear that debris. Wonder if the robotics dispenser still functional?
Veso	interacts with	It's Veso, most lucrative and sagacious visionary. Yes, I can try. There's a trace conduit nearby, I can bypass it--
Veso	interacts with	Confirming tech aboard! Veso-R at your service, most gilded director, most...!
Alad V	interacts with	Attention crew, stand down, all stations. You'll be pleased to know that I, Alad V. have negotiated a peaceful... and profitable... transfer of power to our new--
Alad V	interacts with	Just in time, too! Our new management is about to pay a personal visit. Be quick; I've got to stand down fire when they dock with us! Well done, Viko!
Alad V	interacts with	Clever. Get to it.
Alad V	interacts with	You see. This is why we need that command override back. The board just can't face reality. So what's your plan, Teso?
Alad V	interacts with	Our... uh... victory is ever-nearer, crew! Your service and sacrifice will be richly rewarded, yes!
Alad V	interacts with	Look outside! We'll all about to be under new management! Now do your part or I'll find a more forward-thinking replacement.
Alad V	interacts with	If I don't stand down fire control soon, we'll all be sucking vacuum! Teko! What's taking so long?
Alad V	interacts with	Someone has, yes. I'll pull some meat-crews to cover you. Just get me that override... um?
Alad V	interacts with	--Great, yes, do your thing. There's a nice bonus in it if you can.
Alad V	interacts with	Yes, yes thank Profit! My command overrides aren't working. I need to break fire control from the fleet. Can you fix that, Veko?
Alad V	interacts with	Hold fast to your stations, crews! Our glorious victory is close at hand! Oh, and, uh, any remaining techs aboard, narrow-band me at once!
Kahl	interacts with	For the... huh... For my brothers.
