Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	There! You are so close! Detonate near enough and your brothers shall live to fight another day!
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	Hmmm. Brother Kahl... yes! Find something with a high enough yield! Hurry!
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	Impossible. Even if you could get close to that thing, they'd eat you alive.
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	Mission? That Bloated Condrix swats us down like flies. We're grounded.
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	Worms have jammed our exfil systems. All ships are grounded.
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	One-seven-five. The worms close in. Hurry brother!
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	For the Queens. Now... run MAGGOT, RUUUUNNN!
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	BROTHER? Brother. The WORMS have swarmed the sector, but we will prevail. Regroup on my beacon.
Councilor Vay Hek	interacts with	Eight squad! Eight squad! YOU MAGGOTS! REPORT!
Erra	interacts with	Arrrrrrgggg! The final Archon... it... will be waiting for you. Maybe its power will... make her whole again... give her enough strength to resist.
Erra	interacts with	When the Lotus reaches him, he will make her his puppet. Together, they will annihilate the sun. And so. My sister must...
Erra	interacts with	Follow me.
Erra	interacts with	My father was right... but it's too late. I cannot stop Ballas... no one can. Soon my people... and yours too... will all be destroyed for the pride of one man.
Erra	interacts with	...but not them... Then what is your command?
Erra	interacts with	What does it matter? We-- you have won. Narmer spreads across the system. Monuments rise to your glory. All who live, bios and not, kneel before you--
Erra	interacts with	It is her, I am certain.
Erra	interacts with	Why do you conspire against me father? There is peace and dominion now. The first in centuries. Our people will finally flourish as we were meant to, atop the pyramid of living things. All of us... as one.
Erra	interacts with	A second chance? I see. You're not just trying to stop my Archons from finding her... you're trying to bring her back yourself. Either way, she'll soon be returned to us and this time... as Natah. Purged of Tenno lies and human weakness.
Erra	interacts with	I know you. I feel it. Itching in my mind. You're not just some lucky Drifter, are you? Well, my Archon will be prepared for you and your friend. I'm afraid that luck of yours is all spent.
Erra	interacts with	--see what? A century of your failures? Your betrayal of your own people? Narmer has given our people more than you ever could. Victory. When my Archons have crushed this scant-fly, you'll be back to rotting in the deep. Alone.
Erra	interacts with	A curious weapon, Drifter. You seem to have made a powerful friend.
Erra	interacts with	One for the reject pile, then.
Erra	interacts with	Call out, old man. Give her justice, give her peace!
Erra	interacts with	Summon your devil. It's time.
Erra	interacts with	Call out, Dax.
Erra	interacts with	Do you think there's a shred of Lotus left in Natah? All this time, it's been dying. A tumor scorched from its rotting hole.
Erra	interacts with	How tediously human. A slapdash alliance making a feeble last stand. IF you all crave death in a final flash of glory - I am more than happy to oblige.
Erra	interacts with	Don't be afraid.
Erra	interacts with	Don't be afraid.
Ballas	interacts with	Mar-Margulis?
Ballas	interacts with	You monstrous bitch!
Ballas	interacts with	Now kneel...
Ballas	interacts with	Alone at last.
Ballas	interacts with	'Run'? Where should they run to? You've only destroyed everything!
Ballas	interacts with	And so the monstrosity dies... beautifully.
Ballas	interacts with	What are you? Tell me that. What barren, disgusting thing have I let into my house and my heart? Tell me!
Ballas	interacts with	People warned me against you, you know. Early on, before the Jade Light. I should've listened.
Ballas	interacts with	My vision was only ever comprehensible to myself. My ambition beyond the grasp of... 'people'. Thus I have always been alone. Your death changes nothing.
Ballas	interacts with	Very well: I give you my death - and yours as well. The unstoppable annihilation of every. Single! Last! Thing! Pleased? Satisfied? Are you now full up with death?
Ballas	interacts with	(yells)
Ballas	interacts with	I cast you from my sight. 'Lotus.'
Ballas	interacts with	She has this coming. Do not interfere again.
Ballas	interacts with	You never understood me, my vision. My future lies with Tau. Not here. Not with you.
Ballas	interacts with	Her kind can't feel pain. All lies.
Ballas	interacts with	Shut. Up. You are making me do this. And when this child is dead you and I will have words.
Ballas	interacts with	Very well - she can take your punishment for you.
Ballas	interacts with	Pitiful, broken thing. A puppet accusing her maker of... a lack of substance? Was it?
Ballas	interacts with	Pitiful. I am loved.
Ballas	interacts with	Yes, let's discuss 'what I did.' I who have endured your torture of me. Your lies. Your betrayals. Without. Complaint. All for you. And this is my reward.
Ballas	interacts with	You HAD to have a 'child' - and with an open heart I gave you... this. And my reward? Being left to watch as all your love- MY. LOVE. - poured into the bottomless well of this... abominable child.
Ballas	interacts with	There's a good girl. Repair the hurt you have dealt us. Have dealt me.
Ballas	interacts with	Now... kill your child. For me.
Ballas	interacts with	Say 'I love you, my master.'
Ballas	interacts with	Why do you make me do these things?
Ballas	interacts with	But you can't, can you? Still desperate to save her from herself. You never truly knew her, did you? What she most needs?
Ballas	interacts with	I loved you once... you were so like her.
Ballas	interacts with	Kneel! Kneel, and I will spare these worlds. Beg, and I will make you complete again!
Ballas	interacts with	What a glorious reunion! You and mother-dearest both come to send me on my way. I am ready, Tenno... are you?
Ballas	interacts with	WE. ARE. --
Ballas	interacts with	What will become of you, my people, my flock? You will join me there, of course... but by another path. The path of sacrifice. The path of oblivion. Cleansed of all doubt, for you will peer into the pitch of day and find the SUN is gone. Its heart rendered, beating in my hand... the cost of my passage!
Ballas	interacts with	My people. Long have you waited for the sign. I have delivered it! Look to the sky! It grows darker by the moment. That darkness gathers strength. Strength enough to open the Void and bear me onward to sacred Tau!
Ballas	interacts with	My people. Today we begin a great ascension. For as long as I have lived, a chain dragged behind me. Keeping Tau always beyond grasp. We made our sacrifices... but always with one foot lingering on the shore. Never willing to leave it all behind. Never willing to burn the boats and commit, completely, to that opposite shore. That is why these worlds must die.
Ballas	interacts with	Gather the fleet. She is coming to us - what's left of her. She will kneel before me and, by my word, slaughter the only thing she has ever loved. And then? We feast.
Ballas	interacts with	You see some great triumph here? That this dullard herd worships me? Wailing 'freedom' from their rotten gobs when the truth is... they all thirst for that piss-warm comfort of being told what to think. They wanted to kneel!
Ballas	interacts with	--but not THEM!
Ballas	interacts with	Even hell was not hot enough to split them!
Ballas	interacts with	Tenno?!
Ballas	interacts with	But of course your Archons have her.
Ballas	interacts with	Devils from that other hell.
Ballas	interacts with	You cannot kill the devil, Tenno! ...but you can send it back to hell!
Ballas	interacts with	--Child, my child, forgive me. Wake from this horrid dream of hers. The world outside is waiting for you. These horrors of Zariman... are lies only to hold you ill. I... love you.
Ballas	interacts with	Purge, and purge again, until only the truth remains. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	There are those who hate and fear the truth. And well they might. For the truth is a surgeon's scalpel and has no mercy for what is foul and diseased.
Ballas	interacts with	Seek out those who still walk within the smoke of confusion, and cry aloud for comfort. Take their hands and guide them into the light. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	Just as a crystal lens first brought the heavenly bodies within the sight of man, so does the Veil show us the world as it truly is.
Ballas	interacts with	This bounty I give to you freely. Not the spoils of conquest, nor the profit of trade, but the gift of a loving father. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	My ears rang with a cacophany of chaos and I said: Be still.
Ballas	interacts with	I saw a system divided, and I brought unity. I went over the orphans of war, and I brought peace.
Ballas	interacts with	One cord alone may snap, but a rope woven of many cords may bind. All must do their part. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	Stand strong. Stand together.
Ballas	interacts with	They breed in the midnight places. A pestilence. You have known them of old. Told tales of their evil.
Ballas	interacts with	But come sooner rather than later, for our pity shall only last so long. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	To those who imagined that any shall be rejected, hear this: there is room for you too, in this better world.
Ballas	interacts with	We see your fear, your hesitation, and we say come into the warm.
Ballas	interacts with	To those few who have yet to embrace Narmer, hear this: we understand.
Ballas	interacts with	We bear the scars, we mourn the dead, and we must never allow ourselves to forget. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	Future generations won't remember the Tenno oppression, but we do.
Ballas	interacts with	Savor the taste of liberty my friends. Don't ever relax your vigilance. All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	A nightmare is over. Finally we see clearly. Finally we speak freely.
Ballas	interacts with	All as one.
Ballas	interacts with	Ostron clades starved for Tenno tithe.
Ballas	interacts with	But now is our time. An era of peace and security. The devils have been cast out. And by the Void... the Tenno shall never return!
Ballas	interacts with	Grineer languished in their torture-plexes. Ostron clades starved for Tenno tithe. Corpus pupils weeping Tenno praise under blade. Solaris souls blackened the skies of Tenno foundries.
Ballas	interacts with	I stand before you... last of my kind. An orphan of Tenno massacres. But their violence did not end with me, did it? It carried on... to all of you.
Ballas	interacts with	All... as one.
Ballas	interacts with	...but you can send it back to hell!
Ballas	interacts with	You cannot kill the devil, Tenno!
Ballas	interacts with	Goodbye, my love.
Ballas	interacts with	See the Veil work. Turning his memories inside out. Making him see the things he's lost. Putting pain where it serves us. A lost love, perhaps... her life, cut short by the very Tenno he had sworn to protect.
Ballas	interacts with	He'll give in soon. They all will... and this war will be over before it even begins. Not with bombs and blood... but with truth. They programmed you and your kind. Now it is our turn to program them.
Ballas	interacts with	You're going to want to see this. Watch the Veil do its work.
Ballas	interacts with	Wake up, sleepyhead.
Ballas	interacts with	That's it. Come to me, old man. I am eager to show you how this war ends. Not with brutality, but with hope. Not with lies, but truth. A truth for all who are strong enough to believe. Even you.
Ballas	interacts with	She and her void brood toppled a golden age of order and honor. Do you really believe this chaos is freedom?
Ballas	interacts with	The Tenno freed you from your oath, did they? Does that absolve them of their sins?
Ballas	interacts with	The Devil sends their relic to do the deed. But then... we're both relics aren't we, old man?
Ballas	interacts with	At once the same... yet... ever changed.
Ballas	interacts with	Growing in the light... fading in the dark...
